{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and govern a thriving Singapore in this city builder demo! Plan your city with tactical building placements, recruit a powerful Cabinet, and secure Building Blueprints during heated parliament sessions. Rally citizen support to ensure re-election and shape your nation's future one term at a time!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Dream City</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically design your city by placing buildings in optimal locations to unlock their full potential. In this demo, you\u2019ll have access to <strong>6 out of 8 Building Types</strong>, each offering unique benefits and possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019990/extras/75d3b46599e7314727e21df68327085f.poster.avif?t=1758011220\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019990/extras/75d3b46599e7314727e21df68327085f.webm?t=1758011220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019990/extras/75d3b46599e7314727e21df68327085f.mp4?t=1758011220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reap the Rewards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score points at the end of each turn based on the strategic placement of your buildings. Enhance your gameplay by pairing buildings with <strong>55 diverse Cabinet Members</strong>, unlocking unique synergies and experimenting with different strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019990/extras/ecfe062f4a7a951233c99845024af82b.poster.avif?t=1758011220\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019990/extras/ecfe062f4a7a951233c99845024af82b.webm?t=1758011220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019990/extras/ecfe062f4a7a951233c99845024af82b.mp4?t=1758011220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Navigate the Halls of Parliament</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for Parliament Sessions by acquiring Blueprints to construct pivotal buildings. Assemble a dynamic Cabinet to secure your place as a master city planner and politician.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019990/extras/d1467a3075358d258b34d0d9026d3223.poster.avif?t=1758011220\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019990/extras/d1467a3075358d258b34d0d9026d3223.webm?t=1758011220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019990/extras/d1467a3075358d258b34d0d9026d3223.mp4?t=1758011220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Win the Election</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outmaneuver your rivals and dominate the political landscape to emerge victorious in the ultimate city-building showdown!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019990/extras/9d53c36ef2dc53d269e163f9406700b7.poster.avif?t=1758011220\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019990/extras/9d53c36ef2dc53d269e163f9406700b7.webm?t=1758011220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019990/extras/9d53c36ef2dc53d269e163f9406700b7.mp4?t=1758011220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rally the Legends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a new <strong>Legendary tier of Cabinet Members</strong>, inspired by Singaporean folklore and history. These extraordinary figures bring powerful, game-changing abilities that can redefine your city-building strategies. A single Legendary can shift the balance of power, offering thrilling new ways to dominate Parliament and win elections.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>55 Cabinet Members</strong> (out of 100 in the full game, including Legendary characters)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 out of 8 Building Types</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A single playable map</strong> to test your strategies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4019990?t=1758011220","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4019990?t=1758011220","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019990/681fb7a5d535665e4a504a3aa45f63ac8da9297c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758011220","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019990/681fb7a5d535665e4a504a3aa45f63ac8da9297c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758011220","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and govern a thriving Singapore in this city builder demo! Plan your city with tactical building placements, recruit a powerful Cabinet, and secure Building Blueprints during heated parliament sessions. Rally citizen support to ensure re-election and shape your nation's future one term at a time!</p><h2 class