ingle Legendary can shift the balance of power, offering thrilling new ways to dominate Parliament and win elections.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>55 Cabinet Members</strong> (out of 100 in the full game, including Legendary characters)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 out of 8 Building Types</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A single playable map</strong> to test your strategies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["That One Time I Made A Game Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3374440","name":"Majulah: Shape Your City"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019990/1873fcbe24c14a7fef1a3ec0250e51886c8c2c40/header.jpg?t=1758011220","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 Big Sur<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 (quad-core) or Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Iris Plus / Radeon Pro 5300 / Apple M1 integrated GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Runs on Apple Silicon via Rosetta 2 or native build.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 13 Ventura<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 Pro / Intel Core i7 (6-core or better)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1 Pro GPU / AMD Radeon Pro 5500M or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Best experienced on App